            <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary">
              GitHub 榜要打几百次接口、还要读写几十 MB 的 <code class="rounded bg-surface-2 px-1 py-0.5">content/github.json</code>，
              Worker 跑不了这种任务，所以流程放在 GitHub Actions。给 API Worker 配好下面两个 Secret 后本页就能用：
            </p>
            <pre class="mt-2 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg bg-surface-2 p-3 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary">wrangler secret put GITHUB_TOKEN   # fine-grained PAT：contents 读写 + actions 读写
wrangler secret put GITHUB_REPO    # 例如 yourname/horizons</pre>
            <p id="gh-setup-missing" class="mt-2 text-[11px] text-ink-muted"></p>
          </div>

