              <div id="gh-kpi-board" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tabular-nums tracking-tight">—</div>
              <div id="gh-kpi-board-sub" class="mt-2 text-xs text-ink-secondary">—</div>
            </article>
            <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">候选池</div>
              <div id="gh-kpi-candidates" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tabular-nums tracking-tight">—</div>
              <div id="gh-kpi-candidates-sub" class="mt-2 text-xs text-ink-secondary">—</div>
            </article>
            <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">待发布</div>
              <div id="gh-kpi-pending" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tabular-nums tracking-tight">—</div>
              <div id="gh-kpi-pending-sub" class="mt-2 text-xs text-ink-secondary">—</div>
            </article>
            <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
              <div class="text-xs font-medium text-ink-muted">显著位次变动</div>
              <div id="gh-kpi-changes" class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tabular-nums tracking-tight">—</div>
              <div id="gh-kpi-changes-sub" class="mt-2 text-xs text-ink-secondary">—</div>
            </article>
          </div>

          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-border p-4">
              <div>
                <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold">采集榜单</h2>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">
                  重算现榜数值并搜索新项目，结果先进入候选池，不会改动线上榜单
                </p>
