                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">读的是当前生效版本，与前台榜单一致</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
              <table class="w-full min-w-[760px] text-left text-sm">
                <thead class="bg-surface-2/60 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-muted">
